00:01:27.681 --> 00:01:29.248
- Jared, good question about blogging.

00:01:29.248 --> 00:01:31.129
Blogging, you know, what's
happened with blogging,

00:01:31.129 --> 00:01:33.056
is blogging is massively important

00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:35.262
it's just not the thing
that people talk about.

00:01:35.262 --> 00:01:37.166
Not only that, blogging became so big

00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:38.745
it become the establishment.

00:01:38.745 --> 00:01:41.113
I mean if you have a website and you're

00:01:41.113 --> 00:01:42.785
putting out content on
it, you're blogging.

00:01:42.785 --> 00:01:45.966
And what has also happened
is social networking

00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:50.099
has in theory become the micro
version of that blogging.

00:01:50.099 --> 00:01:51.863
And so now everybody in theory,

00:01:51.863 --> 00:01:53.675
as a matter of fact
Twitter was flat out known

00:01:53.675 --> 00:01:56.513
as a microblogging platform for many.

00:01:58.079 --> 00:01:58.930
Zak?

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.323
