00:02:00.323 --> 00:02:01.768
(laughter)

00:02:01.768 --> 00:02:03.916
I feel like you were
hacking the show, right.

00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:05.704
Like you put them on knowing
that I would respond to that

00:02:05.704 --> 00:02:07.508
and then get on camera.
- [Zak] I just want fame.

00:02:07.518 --> 00:02:08.844
Got it, okay, okay, cool.

00:02:09.568 --> 00:02:10.493
That was amazing.

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:15.087
Twitter was known as a
microblogging platform.

00:02:15.087 --> 00:02:17.801
So I think Facebook and Instagram

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:19.952
and you know Medium,

00:02:19.952 --> 00:02:22.456
there's platforms that
people are now using.

00:02:22.456 --> 00:02:24.096
Because what people
started understanding was

00:02:24.096 --> 00:02:25.080
they want exposure.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.030
If you're blogging you
wanna talk to the world.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:30.513
What people aren't as good
at is actually getting

00:02:30.513 --> 00:02:32.463
people then to come and see that.

00:02:32.463 --> 00:02:35.992
They're relying on SEO back in the day

00:02:35.992 --> 00:02:36.921
and things of that nature.

00:02:36.921 --> 00:02:38.013
What people realized is that people

00:02:38.013 --> 00:02:40.547
are living in Instagram and in Pinterest

00:02:40.547 --> 00:02:42.799
and in Facebook and in Twitter.

00:02:42.799 --> 00:02:45.539
And so they're now going to
the people and blogging there.

00:02:45.539 --> 00:02:47.583
You know, telling a story in your home

00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:49.347
and nobody's there is quite lonely

00:02:49.347 --> 00:02:50.137
and not that interesting.

00:02:50.137 --> 00:02:51.460
That was what would
happen to a lot of people

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:52.877
in the blogging sphere.

00:02:52.877 --> 00:02:56.406
Whereas going to town
hall and getting on there

00:02:56.406 --> 00:02:57.504
and grabbing a mic and talking,

00:02:57.504 --> 00:02:58.711
maybe some people will listen.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:02:59.756
But maybe that person was better.

00:02:59.756 --> 00:03:01.776
Everybody's talking, everyone's listening.

00:03:01.776 --> 00:03:03.324
So it's just the evolution.

00:03:03.914 --> 00:03:05.401
The thesis of people wanting communicate

00:03:05.401 --> 00:03:07.072
on the Internet hasn't changed,

00:03:07.072 --> 00:03:10.578
the formation, the way it's looked at,

00:03:10.578 --> 00:03:14.131
the terminology that we
use, the new, you know,

00:03:14.131 --> 00:03:18.434
recarnation of it is just what
you're living in right now.

